# iTerm2 preferences are deliberately untracked — the profiles embed internal
# host references (bound hosts, an ssh command to an internal address,
# hostname-trigger regexes for internal subnets). See "Deliberately not
# managed here" in the README. Ignored rather than merely undocumented so a
# `git add -A` cannot commit them by accident.
